ch0259_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"裙摆缠住了……","text_original":"裾が絡んでしまった...","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_battle_retire.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_battle_shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_battle_shout_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_battle_shout_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_battle_shout_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"出发。","text_original":"行くぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_battle_tacticalaction_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"任务成功。","text_original":"任務成功だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_battle_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"作战完毕。","text_original":"作戦終了。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_battle_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"正适合用来练习潜入作战。","text_original":"潜入作戦の練習にちょうど良さそうだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"总有一天，也要让那些孩子们……穿上礼服。","text_original":"いつか、あの子たちにも……ドレスを。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"任务之外，还有机会穿这件吗……？","text_original":"任務以外でこれを着る機会があるのだろうか……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"感觉到了视线……是不是太显眼了？","text_original":"視線を感じる……もしかして、目立っているのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"便利屋68……果然不是等闲之辈……","text_original":"便利屋68……やはり、只者ではないな……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"进行整备。","text_original":"整備する。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"有什么事吗？","text_original":"どうかしたのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"真的没事吗……","text_original":"何も無いのか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"我很漂亮……？老师真是……净开些奇怪的玩笑。","text_original":"私が、きれい……？先生は……変な冗談を言うんだな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"唔，这种话不要轻易说出口。","text_original":"っ、そういうことを軽々しく言うな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"特殊任务的时间到了。那么，开始吧。","text_original":"特殊任務の時間だ。では、はじめよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"有老师在场，没什么好担心的。","text_original":"先生がいるのなら、問題ないな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"一切顺利。接下来的指挥，也拜托您了。","text_original":"順調だな。このあとの指揮も、よろしく頼む。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"作战已进入尾声。请注意时间分配。","text_original":"作戦は終盤に差しかかっている。時間配分に注意してくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"今后我也……想一直穿着这件。不过大概很难吧。","text_original":"この後も……ずっとこれを着ていたいのだが。難しいのだろうか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"竟然看到了吗。","text_original":"見てしまったのか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"虽无仇怨，但这也是工作。","text_original":"恨みはないが、これも仕事だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"碍事。","text_original":"邪魔だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"永别了！","text_original":"さらばだ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"开路！","text_original":"道を開く！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"哈！","text_original":"はっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"多亏了这套装备，我能应对的工作范围扩大了。不管是什么委托，都给我放马过来。","text_original":"おかげで遂行できる仕事の幅が増えた。依頼でもなんでも、応えてみせよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"是特殊任务吗？","text_original":"特別な任務か。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"速战速决吧。","text_original":"迅速に終わらせよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"真是精准的指挥。","text_original":"的確な采配だな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是阿里乌斯小队的纱织……这身装扮，是为了任务而穿的。……真的。","text_original":"アリウススクワッドのサオリだ……これは、任務のために着ている。……本当だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"感谢您的支援。","text_original":"支援、感謝する。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"……我一定会回应老师的期待。","text_original":"……先生の期待に応えてみせよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"正因为有老师在身边……我才能一路向前。","text_original":"先生がいてくれたから……私は前を向くことができた。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"我对老师的感激之情，虽然想回报给老师……抱歉，我不知道该怎么办才好。","text_original":"先生に感謝の気持ちを返したいのだが……すまない、どうすればいいのか分からない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"听说这种礼服，只在特别的日子才会穿。","text_original":"こういったドレスは、特別な日に着用するものだと聞いた。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然我之前并不知道……。","text_original":"そうとは知らなかったのだが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"没有别的意思。只是……难得换了衣服，就想让您看看。","text_original":"他意があったわけではない。ただ……せっかく着替えたのだから、見てもらいたくて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"……以后我穿上这件衣服时，也可以再来见您吗？","text_original":"……これを着た時に、また会いに行っても良いだろうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"……只要这样，那一天就可以变成特别的日子了。","text_original":"……それだけで特別な日になるから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师……等你好久了。……以这种装扮出来迎接，感觉有些害羞。","text_original":"おかえりなさい、先生……待っていたぞ。……この格好で出迎えるのは、少し気恥ずかしいな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"是服装的影响吗？感觉比平时更能大胆地行动了。无论什么任务，我都一定会完成给你看。","text_original":"服装の影響だろうか？いつもより大胆な動きができるようになった。どんな任務でも遂行してみせよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"这，这样做就行了吗……？","text_original":"こ、こうすればいいのか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果是老师的要求的话……不过，这有点……","text_original":"先生がいうのなら……だが、これは少し……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_memoriallobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"平时我是绝不会摆出这样的姿势的。","text_original":"普段は、絶対取らないポーズだから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_memoriallobby_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"双手都用上了，总觉得有些不安。","text_original":"両手が塞がっていると、少し不安になる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果不信赖搭档的话，实在很难做到。","text_original":"パートナーを信頼していなければ難しいな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"难道说……这真是一种用来表示信赖的社交行为吗？","text_original":"もしかして……それを示す挨拶、だったのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_memoriallobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"那么……就一直这样，直到老师满意为止。","text_original":"ならば……先生が満足するまで、こうしていよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"那便是……我对信赖的证明。","text_original":"それが……私の信頼の証だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_memoriallobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"感觉胸口比平时更难受……老师，您知道原因吗？","text_original":"普段よりも胸が苦しい気がする……先生なら、理由を知っているだろうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"多亏了与老师的相遇，让许多事情都发生了变化。不只是这身衣服……我自己也变了。","text_original":"先生と出会ったおかげで、色々なことに変化が起きた。この服もそうだし……私自身も。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"我发誓……直到最后也要回报老师的信任。","text_original":"最後まで……先生の信頼に応えると誓おう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"即便不是为了任务，我也想试穿这件礼服……为了老师而穿，如果可以的话。","text_original":"任務関係なく、このドレスに袖を通してみたいものだ……できれば、先生のために。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"\"我出生的那天并无意义\"…………这是以前的我的想法。但如今不一样了……这也是多亏了老师。","text_original":"私が生まれた日に、意味などない…………昔はそう考えていた。だが、今は違う……これも先生のおかげだな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"为了今天，我练习了舞步。愿意和我共舞吗？","text_original":"今日のために、ステップを練習したんだ。一緒に、踊ってくれるか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"这身感觉不适合作为万圣节的装扮……也许戴点什么会更好？","text_original":"ハロウィーンの仮装にはそぐわないな……なにか被り物でもした方が良いのだろうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"你去新年参拜了吗？我刚去过回来。至于许了什么愿……保密。","text_original":"お参りには行ったか？私も今行ってきたところだ。何を願ったのかは……秘密だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣夜似乎是用来与重要的人共度的……我没有别的意思。","text_original":"聖夜は、大切な人と過ごすものらしいな。……深い意味はない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"是我的错……","text_original":"私のせいだ...","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%E7%A4%BC%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0259_tactic_defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0259_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"毫无意义……果然吗……","text_original":"無意味…だったか…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%94%AD%E5%89%8D%20%E7%BA%B1%E7%BB%87/%